OL,3,AGoogle rejects UK request for Russell
OL,4,ABrand YouTube video to be removed,
OL,5,Asources say
OL,6,
OL,7,FGoogle has refused a government request
OL,8,Fto remove a YouTube video posted by
OL,9,Fjailed rapist Russell Brand's wife in
OL,10,Fwhich he claims his innocence,
OL,11,FWhitehall sources have told the BBC.
OL,13,FThe Prison Service of England and Wales
OL,14,Fsubmitted the request. A Ministry of
OL,15,FJustice (MoJ) spokesperson said "it was
OL,16,Fonly right" to ask for content that was
OL,17,F"distressing for victims" to be
OL,18,Fremoved.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
