OL,3,AGoogle rejects UK request for Russell
OL,4,ABrand YouTube video to be removed,
OL,5,Asources say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe comedian is currently serving a
OL,8,F10-and-half-year prison sentence after
OL,9,Fbeing convicted of rape and three
OL,10,Fcounts of sexual assault.
OL,12,FGoogle told BBC News in a statement it
OL,13,Fwas "aware of the new content and our
OL,14,Fteams are investigating".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
