OL,5,G0600 Today
OL,6,G0900 In Our Time
OL,7,     FMisha Glenny and guests discuss
OL,8,     Fthe radical artists and poets who
OL,9,     Fcreated a new kind of art and
OL,10,     Fculture, and became infamous for
OL,11,     Fboth their work and their complex
OL,12,     Fpersonal lives.
OL,13,G0945 Strong Message Here
OL,14,     FNatalie Haynes and Ayesha Hazarika
OL,15,     Fjoin Armando to look at the
OL,16,     Flanguage we are hearing in the
OL,17,     Fwake of the conviction of Russell
OL,18,     FBrand, and accusations elsewhere
OL,19,     Fin public life.
